# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the sanitizers job: memory Mesa's OpenGL driver keeps until exit. The job links
# libGLX (KEEP_GL in ci.yml), so the driver stays loaded until the leak report and its frames are matched here by
# module. A leak whose stack doesn't pass through Mesa is still reported, wherever it is in our code.
leak:libGLX_mesa.so
leak:libgallium
leak:swrast_dri.so
